# Face-data backups (backup_face_data output).
# These contain face embeddings — biometric data about real students, much of
# it about minors. They must never enter version control: git history would
# retain them after deletion, and a public repository would publish them.
# Keep backups outside the working tree.
backup*.json
*-backup.json
face-backup*.json
